      "reason": "RTU validates bounded binary frames, CRC, unit, function and exceptions. ASCII validates colon/CRLF delimiters, bounded even-length hexadecimal payloads, LRC, unit, function and exceptions. Both use configured bounded response timeouts and one in-flight transaction.",
